Actually, finding things exercises wisdom, not simply searching.
There's no use holding down s for a million turns.

From time to time, the game checks how well you have been behaving. If
you exercised wisdom much more than you abused it, you gain one point.
Likely, that check kicked in while you were searching.

See http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/Exercise for the full details.


